      "punte": [
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Die water hou die pot 'n bietjie warmer as die kookwater self.': Read alone, this says the water makes the pot warmer; the point seems to be that the water keeps the pot from getting much hotter than boiling water (perhaps 'net 'n bietjie'). Fixing it means guessing the intended claim, so it is left to the writer.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Elke keer word die koper dunner en langer en dit breek nie.': 'Elke keer' implies repeated pulling, but the sentence before mentions only one pull through one hole; the repetition is not stated, so a change would add content.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Baie potte begin hulle lewe as 'n plat stuk metaal sonder enige vorm.': A flat piece does have a shape, so 'sonder enige vorm' is loose; possibly meant 'nog sonder 'n pot se vorm'. Left unchanged because it touches meaning.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Jy ken metaal uit aan al hierdie eienskappe saam.': 'hierdie eienskappe' points forward to properties not yet named in this block; it works as an introduction, but the referent is vague for a reader of the opening block."
      ]
